This repository contains no file of the game: no Klei source code, game binaries, game
assets or game data. Building it needs a built copy of oni-sim-replacement, whose ABI
headers are read from that repository and not copied here. Running it on a recorded
corpus needs a corpus recorded from your own game, which is not part of this repository
and must not be redistributed.

No third-party source code is included. The program's own drawing of the cells and the PNG
writer are this project's own. Three third-party components are used, and their licences are in
LICENSES/ (see LICENSES/THIRD-PARTY.md):

- Qt 6.8.3, under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3, linked dynamically. A build puts
  the unmodified Qt DLLs and platform plugins beside simviz.exe. Qt's source is published by
  the Qt Project at https://download.qt.io.
- The MinGW-w64 runtime DLLs that Qt needs: GCC's runtime libraries under GPLv3 with the GCC
  Runtime Library Exception 3.1, and winpthreads under MIT and BSD-style terms.
- The DejaVu fonts in assets/fonts/, compiled into simviz.exe, under the Bitstream Vera licence
  (DejaVu's changes are public domain).
